$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=rectintid  LOC_AFTER=?

* The local identity theorem: a holomorphic function on a rectangle whose Taylor coefficients about a strictly interior centre P all vanish is zero at every strictly interior point within half the distance R from P to the boundary frame.

